WEBVTT

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.299
Mbaj mend si i studionim fotograite e saj

00:00:31.299 --> 00:00:35.411
dhe pastaj kercenim te dyja me muziken e zgjedhur.

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:40.033
Kur une isha 8 dhe ajo 60,

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.086
dicka ndryshoi.

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:44.440
Ajo ndaloi se punuari dhe udhetuari.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.131
Nuk kercente me.

00:00:46.131 --> 00:00:48.884
Nuk pinim me kafe.

00:00:48.884 --> 00:00:51.068
Nena ime linte punen qe ta conte ate neper doktore

00:00:51.068 --> 00:00:53.454
te cilet nuk jepnin dot nje diagnoze.

00:00:53.454 --> 00:00:58.791
Babai im, qe punonte naten, rrinte me te dites,

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:01.876
qe te sigurohej qe ajo hante.